               "text": "Weisstein, Eric W.",
               "page": "https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Greater.html",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Un Número Que Viene Después Es Mayor\n\nEn la regla, un número que viene después de otro es mayor. Usamos el símbolo (>), así **21 > 20** significa “21 es mayor que 20”.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "da732905-3ece-495a-807a-fff8b3dd6e3c",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "da732905-3ece-495a-807a-fff8b3dd6e3c",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
